        <key>boundary</key>
        <string>Source hypothesis only from frozen1.1.0 geometry. Actual curve/weight/counter, five-role attachment, spacing/native16/24 and phonetic recognition remain open. A smooth control-point field is not a C1 or reading guarantee.</string>
        <key>caseSpecificRationale</key>
        <string>Preserve the native stretched-C lower curve, open terminal and complete deep extent.</string>
        <key>construction</key>
        <string>Preserve the native stretched-C lower curve, open terminal and complete deep extent. Keep the lower control zone fixed, shift the middle body by half the genuine SC frame increment and place the upper cap at the actual same-cut genuine SC rounded top. Use two bounded joining fields along the native italic axis and retain native outside-bearing roles. No ordinary delta/C alias, lower-extent truncation, whole-capital reduction or synthetic italic.</string>
